			"notes": "Update to 1.18.2 by ZestyBlaze\n\n__Get Fired up everyone! Kiln is back!!__\nHey everyone! I'm Blaze, a fairly new modder in the scene and I've joined forces with LemmaEOF to begin porting their mods to newer versions! First up is Kiln!\n\nNot a lot has changed, here is what is in this version!\n\n \n\n- Updated everything from 1.16 to 1.18\n\n- Added in particles when the Kiln is smelting\n\n- Added in light when the kiln is smelting\n- Added in a config option for the Kiln automatically being on in the Nether in case people think it's too OP!"
		},
